Created datePublished" datetime="2022-04-27T12:28:48.629Z" title="更新于 2022-04-27 20:28:48">2022-04-27</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator"></span><span class="post-meta-wordcount"><i class="anzhiyufont anzhiyu-icon-file-word post-meta-icon" title="文章字数"></i><span class="post-meta-label" title="文章字数">字数总计:</span><span class="word-count" title="文章字数">1k</span><span class="post-meta-separator"></span><i class="anzhiyufont anzhiyu-icon-clock post-meta-icon" title="阅读时长"></i><span class="post-meta-label" title="阅读时长">阅读时长:</span><span>3分钟</span></span><span class="post-meta-separator"></span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" data-flag-title="Linux 文件目录类常见命令"><i class="anzhiyufont anzhiyu-icon-fw-eye post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label" title="阅读量">阅读量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="anzhiyufont anzhiyu-icon-spinner anzhiyu-spin"></i></span></span><span class="post-meta-separator"> </span><span class="post-meta-position" title="作者IP属地为深圳"><i class="anzhiyufont anzhiyu-icon-location-dot"></i>深圳</span></div></div></div><section class="main-hero-waves-area waves-area"><svg class="waves-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewBox="0 24 150 28" preserveAspectRatio="none" shape-rendering="auto"><defs><path id="gentle-wave" d="M -160 44 c 30 0 58 -18 88 -18 s 58 18 88 18 s 58 -18 88 -18 s 58 18 88 18 v 44 h -352 Z"></path></defs><g class="parallax"><use href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="0"></use><use href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="3"></use><use href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="5"></use><use href="#gentle-wave" x="48" y="7"></use></g></svg></section><div id="post-top-cover"><img class="nolazyload" id="post-top-bg" src="/img/cover/cover5.webp"></div></header><main id="blog-container"><div class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="post-content" id="article-container" itemscope itemtype="https://chifuyong.github.io/linux/file-directory-commands"><header><a class="post-meta-categories" href="/categories/Linux/" itemprop="url">Linux</a><a href="/tags/Linux/" tabindex="-1" itemprop="url">Linux</a><a href="/tags/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F/" tabindex="-1" itemprop="url">文件系统</a><h1 id="CrawlerTitle" itemprop="name headline">Linux 文件目录类常见命令</h1><span itemprop="author" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/Person">chify</span><time itemprop="dateCreated datePublished" datetime="2019-05-28T05:09:28.000Z" title="发表于 2019-05-28 13:09:28">2019-05-28</time><time itemprop="dateCreated datePublished" datetime="2022-04-27T12:28:48.629Z" title="更新于 2022-04-27 20:28:48">2022-04-27</time></header><p>&emsp;&emsp;面对黑压压的Linux界面，为让Linux系统能完成我们想要达到的功能，熟悉Linux的基本命令是必须要做到的，此篇记录的为Linux操作文件目录的常用命令。</p><h3 id="一、文件目录类命令"><a href="#一、文件目录类命令" class="headerlink" title="一、文件目录类命令"></a>一、文件目录类命令</h3><ul><li><strong>1. pwd（Print working directory）</strong></li></ul><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">pwd ：显示当前工作目录的绝对路径</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>2. ls（List files）</strong><br>ls [参数] 目录名：显示目录下的文件。</li></ul><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">ls -a /home  ：表示显示/home下所有文件和目录，包括隐藏的。</span><br><span class="line">ls -l  /home ：表示以列表的方式来显示，可直接简写成 ll（小写L）</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>3. cd（Change directory）</strong></li></ul><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cd 目录 ：进入指定的目录。</span><br><span class="line">cd ~ / cd ：回到自己的家目录。</span><br><span class="line">cd .. ：回到上级目录。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>4. mkdir(Make directory)</strong></li></ul><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mkdir [参数] 目录名：创建一个新的目录。</span><br><span class="line">mkdir -p /home/Person/xiaoming ：一次创建多级目录。</span><br><span class="line">#### rmdir（Remove directory）</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>&emsp;&emsp;rmdir [选项] 目录名： 删除指定的空目录。<br>&emsp;&emsp;注意：这个只能删除空目录，若要删除非空目录，<strong>得使用命令 { rm -rf 目录名 }</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>5. touch</strong><br>touch 文件名 ：创建一个空文件（在当前目录下）</p></li><li><p><strong>6. cp（Copy file）</strong><br>cp [参数] 文件名 目录名：复制文件到某个目录下</p></li></ul><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055443201.png" alt="image-1651055443201"></p><p>&emsp;&emsp;使用 -r 参数，将整个文件夹复制到指定目录中去。</p><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055451102.png" alt="image-1651055451102"></p><p>&emsp;&emsp;复制中难免出现文件重复得情况，出现此中情况会出现提示，每次都需要输入y来确定覆盖文件，如下图：</p><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055461340.png" alt="image-1651055461340"></p><p>&emsp;&emsp;使用\cp -r 命令进行强制覆盖所有需要复制得文件。</p><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055473704.png" alt="image-1651055473704"></p><ul><li><strong>7. rm（Remove file）</strong></li></ul><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">rm  文件名：删除文件。</span><br><span class="line">rm  -rf 目录：删除目录。</span><br><span class="line">        -r 递归删除整个文件夹，</span><br><span class="line">        -f 强制不进行提示进行删除文件。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>8. mv（Move file）</strong><br>mv oldName newName ：用于修改文件名字。<br>mv aaa.txt 目录：移动文件到某个目录下。</li></ul><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055484047.png" alt="image-1651055484047"></p><p>&emsp;&emsp;mv 目录 目录：移动某个目录到另一个目录下</p><ul><li><p><strong>9. cat（Concatenate）</strong><br>cat 文件名：用只读得方式读取文件内容。<strong>此命令通常与管道命令一起使用</strong><br>-n 可显示行号</p></li><li><p><strong>10. more</strong><br>more 文件：按页显示文件的内容。一次性直接加载文件所有内容，适合查看小文件内容。操作快捷键如下：</p></li></ul><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">空白键：向下翻页。</span><br><span class="line">Enter：向下翻一行。</span><br><span class="line">q：立即离开more，不再显示文件内容。</span><br><span class="line">Ctrl + F：向下滚动一个屏幕</span><br><span class="line">Ctrl + B：返回上一个屏幕</span><br><span class="line">=：输出当前行号</span><br><span class="line">:f    ：输出文件名和当前行号</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>11. less</strong><br>less 文件：分屏查看文件内容。与more命令类似，但是功能比它强大。加载内容是按需加载，适合查看大型文件内容，效率较高。快捷键如下：</li></ul><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">空白键：向下翻一页。</span><br><span class="line">pagedown：向下翻一页。</span><br><span class="line">pageup：向上翻一页。</span><br><span class="line">/字符串：向下搜索&quot;字符串&quot;功能（n：向下查找下一个，N：向上查找）</span><br><span class="line">？字符串：向上搜索&quot;字符串&quot;功能（n：向上查找下一个，N：向下查找）</span><br><span class="line">q：离开less显示页面。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>12. &gt; 、 &gt;&gt;</strong><br>功能：能将打印的内容写入到相应的文件。<br>例如：</li></ul><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055498004.png" alt="image-1651055498004"></p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">**&gt;** ：会将原来的内容删去后再写入。</span><br><span class="line">**&gt;&gt;**：不会删除原来的内容，而是往后追加。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ul><li><strong>13. echo</strong><br>echo “Hello World”：输出Hello World到屏幕。<br>例如：</li></ul><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055514002.png" alt="image-1651055514002"></p><ul><li><strong>14. head</strong><br>head 文件：显示文件内容的前10行。<br>head -n 5：显示文件内容的前5行，可以是任意行数。<br>例如：</li></ul><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055525480.png" alt="image-1651055525480"></p><ul><li><p><strong>15. tail</strong><br>tail 文件：查看文件后内容，默认为10行。<br>tail -n 5 文件：查看文件后 5 行内容，可以是任意行数。<br>tail -f 文件：实时监控此文件的所有更新，有变化则会显示再屏幕上。</p></li><li><p><strong>16. ln（Link）</strong><br>ln -s [文件&#x2F;目录] 软连接名：类似于Windows里的快捷方式，主要存放了链接其他文件的路径。<br><strong>注意：使用 pwd 时显示的还是 ln 链接的目录</strong><br>例如：</p></li></ul><p><img src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/upload/2022/04/image-1651055533860.png" alt="image-1651055533860"></p><ul><li><strong>17. history</strong><br>history：显示所有命令历史，只显示之前输入的正确的命令，失败的命令不显示。<br>history 5：显示最近使用过正确的5个命令，可以是任意数字。</li></ul></article><div class="post-copyright"><div class="copyright-cc-box"><i class="anzhiyufont anzhiyu-icon-copyright"></i></div><div class="post-copyright__author_box"><a class="post-copyright__author_img" href="/" title="头像"><img class="post-copyright__author_img_back" src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/avatar.png" title="头像" alt="头像"><img class="post-copyright__author_img_front" src= "data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" onerror="this.onerror=null,this.src=&quot;/img/404.jpg&quot;" data-lazy-src="/img/avatar.png" title="头像" alt="头像"></a><div class="post-copyright__author_name">chify</div><div class="post-copyright__author_desc"></div></div><div class="post-copyright__post__info"><a class="post-copyright__original" title="该文章为原创文章，注意版权协议" href="https://chifuyong.github.io/linux/file-directory-commands">原创</a><a class="post-copyright-title"><span onclick='rm.copyPageUrl("https://chifuyong.github.io/linux/file-directory-commands")'>Linux 文件目录类常见命令</span></a></div><div class="post-tools" id="post-tools"><div class="post-tools-left"><div class="rewardLeftButton"></div><div class="shareRight"><div class="share-link mobile"><div class="share-qrcode"><div class="share-button" title="使用手机访问这篇文章"><i class="anzhiyufont anzhiyu-icon-qrcode"></i></div><div class="share-main"><div class="share-main-all"><div id="qrcode" title="https://chifuyong.github.io/linux/file-directory-commands"></div><div